sequenceDiagram
    participant X as VS Code extension
    participant E as Engine (public_editor)
    participant S as Canonical store (editor schema v2)
    X->>E: observe buffer (open identity, version, text hash, root + binding rev)
    E->>S: record observation + native disk evidence
    X->>E: prepare immutable change (task authority)
    loop each file
        X->>E: request per-file admission
        E->>S: commit dispatch intent
        E-->>X: edit for exact version
        X->>X: recheck mapping, trust, version, hash · TextEditor.edit
        alt typing race / stale
            X-->>E: rejected (user text preserved)
        else applied
            X-->>E: applied (before/after version + hash)
        end
        E->>S: per-file receipt (applied / rejected / unknown)
    end
    Note over X,S: Reload reconciles durable IDs · edits never replayed
